{"title": "Heavy Magic Armour Trader Table", "pageid": 14892, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Heavy_Magic_Armour_Trader_Table", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Vendor tables", "Leveled drop tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Heavy Magic Armour Trader Table</b>, also known as <code>EquipmentTrader_BodyArmor_Heavy_Magic</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:EquipmentTrader_BodyArmor_Heavy_Magic+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:EquipmentTrader_BodyArmor_Heavy_Magic+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> containing enchanted <a href=\"/wiki/Armour#Heavy_Armour\" title=\"Armour\">heavy armour</a>. It only starts dropping items after level 2.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_table\">Drop table</span></h2>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Heavy Magic Armour Trader Table}}</code>.</i>\n</p>\n<i>Every item that the player is eligible for is dropped. For example, at level 4 Ring Mail Armour +1 and Chain Mail +1 will be dropped.</i><table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Level 2 - 4\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_Mail_Armour_%2B1\" title=\"Ring Mail Armour +1\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Ring_Mail_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_Mail_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Ring_Mail_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_Mail_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5a/Ring_Mail_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Ring_Mail_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_Mail_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Ring_Mail_Armour_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_Mail_Armour_%2B1\" title=\"Ring Mail Armour +1\">Ring Mail Armour +1</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Level 4 - 6\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chain_Mail_%2B1\" title=\"Chain Mail +1\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Chain_Mail_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Chain_Mail_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Chain_Mail_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Chain_Mail_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ac/Chain_Mail_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Chain_Mail_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Chain_Mail_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Chain_Mail_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></s